## Concrete local source finding

`tests/test_sft_import_qualification_acquisition_v1.py:147` hardcodes
`dir="/private/tmp"` in `AcquisitionTests.setUp`. Seven tests share that setup.
That macOS-specific parent is not created by the Ubuntu workflow. If absent,
those fixtures fail with FileNotFoundError before test execution.

This is a demonstrated portability defect, not confirmation of the remote
exception: the runner's directory existence and raw error were not observed.
The earlier local pass results did not prove this Ubuntu path assumption. No
published file was changed to conceal or repair this failed attempt.

